Phase 9: Timestamp comments ⭐

This is the feature that makes VidTalk interesting.

Suppose the video is currently at:

02:35

User writes:

"This part is important."

We store:

timestamp = 155 seconds

Then the Android UI can display a marker:

Video timeline

0 ────────●────────────●────────── 10:00
          ↑
        2:35

Tap the marker:

seekTo(155000)

and the video jumps directly to that moment.

Phase 10: Replies

Comments become threaded:

Comment
 ├── Reply
 ├── Reply
 └── Reply

Database relationship:

comments.parent_comment_id
Phase 11: Video comments

Now the more advanced feature.

User records a short video response:

CameraX
   ↓
Record video
   ↓
Android
   ↓
FastAPI
   ↓
Cloudinary
   ↓
Video URL
   ↓
